{%- comment -%}
  TIKVES LONDON . AGE GATE PHOTOGRAPH, ANNOUNCED EARLY
  19 Oct 2026, speed. Rendered from layout/theme.liquid, in the head,
  before theme.css.

  The problem it fixes. On a first visit the age gate covers the whole
  screen and its photograph is the largest thing on it. The photograph is
  lazy in the HTML and a script in sections/age-verification-popup.liquid
  turns it eager when there is no gate cookie. That script sits in the
  body, and a script in the body cannot run until theme.css and the other
  stylesheets have arrived. On a slow phone connection that was over a
  second of waiting before the photograph was even asked for. PageSpeed
  on 19 Oct 2026 put the largest paint at about five seconds on the home
  page and on product pages.

  What this does. A script here runs at once, because nothing above it
  blocks it. If there is no gate cookie it adds a preload link for the
  photograph with the same candidate widths and the same sizes as the
  img tag, so the phone picks the same file and the download starts in
  parallel with the stylesheets. A visitor who has already passed the
  gate has the cookie and downloads nothing.

  The filename below must be the photograph set on the age gate in the
  theme editor (sections/popup-group.json, age-verification-popup,
  image). If the gate picture ever changes, change the name here too.
  If the name does not match a file in Content, Files, nothing renders.

  TO UNDO: delete this snippet and its render line in layout/theme.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign tl_gate_img = images['age-gate-vineyard-sunset.jpg'] -%}
{%- if tl_gate_img -%}
<script>
  (function () {
    if (document.cookie.indexOf('AgeVerificationPopup-') !== -1) return;
    var l = document.createElement('link');
    l.rel = 'preload';
    l.as = 'image';
    l.setAttribute('fetchpriority', 'high');
    l.setAttribute('imagesrcset', '{{ tl_gate_img | image_url: width: 352 }} 352w, {{ tl_gate_img | image_url: width: 832 }} 832w, {{ tl_gate_img | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w, {{ tl_gate_img | image_url: width: 1920 }} 1920w, {{ tl_gate_img | image_url: width: 2400 }} 2400w');
    l.setAttribute('imagesizes', '100vw');
    document.head.appendChild(l);
  })();
</script>
{%- endif -%}
